side-box-image\"><span class=\"noviewer skin-invert-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Wiktionary-logo-en-v2.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"Wiktionary logo\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Wiktionary-logo-en-v2.svg/40px-Wiktionary-logo-en-v2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Wiktionary-logo-en-v2.svg/120px-Wiktionary-logo-en-v2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"side-box-text plainlist\">Look up <i><b><a href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/interstellar\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wiktionary:interstellar\">interstellar</a></b></i> in Wiktionary, the free dictionary.</div></div>\n</div>\n<p><b>Interstellar</b> or <b>Interstella</b> may refer to:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1044870489\">@media all and (max-width:720px){body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output .tocright{display:none}.mw-parser-output .tocright{width:100%!important}}@media all and (min-width:720px){.mw-parser-output .tocright{float:right;clear:right;width:auto;margin:0 0 0.5em 1em}.mw-parser-output .tocright-clear-left{clear:left}.mw-parser-output .tocright-clear-both{clear:both}.mw-parser-output .tocright-clear-none{clear:none}}</style><div class=\"tocright\"><meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" /></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Space\">Space</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Interstellar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Space\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Interstellar_space\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Interstellar space\">Interstellar space</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Interstellar_medium\" title=\"Interstellar medium\">Interstellar medium</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Interstellar_travel\" title=\"Interstellar travel\">Interstellar travel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Interstellar_communication\" title=\"Interstellar communication\">Interstellar communication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Interstellar_probe\" title=\"Interstellar probe\">Interstellar probe</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Interstellar_Probe_(spacecraft)\" title=\"Interstellar Probe (spacecraft)\">Interstellar Probe (spacecraft)</a> (ISP), a NASA probe proposed in 2018 for launch in the 2030s.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Interstellar_Express\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Interstellar Express\">Interstellar Express</a> (IHP), Chinese probes proposed in 2019 for launch in 2024.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Art,_entertainment,_and_media\"><span id=\"Art.2C_entertainment.2C_and_media\"></span>Art, entertainment, and media</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Interstellar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Art, entertainment, and media\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Books\">Books</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Interstellar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Books\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Interstellar:_The_Search_for_Extraterrestrial_Life_and_Our_Future_in_the_Stars\" title=\"Interstellar: The Search for Extraterrestrial Life and Our Future in the Stars\">Interstellar: The Search for Extraterrestrial Life and Our Future in the Stars</a></i></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Interstellarum_Deep_Sky_Atlas\" title=\"Interstellarum Deep Sky Atlas\">Interstellarum Deep Sky Atlas</a></i>, a 2014 <a href=\"/wiki/Star_atlas\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Star atlas\">star atlas</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Films_and_soundtracks\">Films and soundtracks</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Interstellar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Films and soundtracks\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Interstella_5555:_The_5tory_of_the_5ecret_5tar_5ystem\" title=\"Interstella 5555: The 5tory of the 5ecret 5tar 5ystem\">Interstella 5555: The 5tory of the 5ecret 5tar 5ystem</a></i>, a 2003 animated film set to Daft Punk's album <i>Discovery</i></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Interstellar_(film)\" title=\"Interstellar (film)\"><i>Interstellar</i> (film)</a>, a 2014 science fiction film directed by Christopher Nolan\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Interstellar_(soundtrack)\" title=\"Interstellar (soundtrack)\"><i>Interstellar</i> (soundtrack)</a>, the soundtrack to the 2014 film <i>Interstellar</i></li></ul></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Music\">Music</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Interstellar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Music\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Groups\">Groups</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Interstellar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Groups\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Intastella\" title=\"Intastella\">Intastella</a>, a band in the second wave of the Manchester music scene</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Interstellar_(band)\" title=\"Interstellar (band)\">Interstellar (band)</a>, a Canadian rock band</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Albums\">Albums</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Interstellar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Albums\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Interstellar_(album)\" title=\"Interstellar (album)\"><i>Interstellar</i> (album)</a>, an album by Frankie Rose</li>\n<li><i> <a href=\"/wiki/Interstellar_Space\" title=\"Interstellar Space\">Interstellar Space</a>,</i> John Coltrane album</li>\n<li><i>Interstellar: The String Quartet Tribute to Interpol</i>, an album by <a href=\"/wiki/Vitamin_String_Quartet\" title=\"Vitamin String Quartet\">Vitamin String Quartet</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Songs\">Songs</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Interstellar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Songs\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>\"Interstellar\", a 2020 song by <a href=\"/wiki/Au5\" title=\"Au5\">Au5</a>, featuring Danyka Nadeau</li>\n<li>\"Interstellar\", a track from the album <i>Folk</i> by <a href=\"/wiki/Ultramarine_(band)\" title=\"Ultramarine (band)\">Ultramarine</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Organizations\">Organizations</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Interstellar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Organizations\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Interstellar_Technologies\" title=\"Interstellar Technologies\">Interstellar Technologies</a>, Japanese company</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"See_also\">See also</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Interstellar&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See also\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Intergalactic_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-redirect mw-disambig\" title=\"Intergalactic (disambiguation)\">Intergalactic (disambiguation)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Interplanetary_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-redirect mw-disambig\" title=\"Interplanetary (disambiguation)\">Interplanetary (disambiguation)</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"shortdescription nomobile noexcerpt noprint searchaux\" style=\"display:none\">Topics referred to by the same term</div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1374546851\">.mw-parser-output .dmbox{display:flex;align-items:center;clear:both;margin:0.9em 1em;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color-subtle,#c8ccd1);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color-subtle,#c8ccd1);padding:0.25em 0.35em;font-style:italic}.mw-parser-output .dmbox>*{flex-shrink:0;margin:0 0.25em}.mw-parser-output .dmbox-body{flex-grow:1;flex-shrink:1;padding:0.1em 0}.mw-parser-output .dmbox-invalid-type{text-align:center}</style>\n<div role=\"note\" id=\"disambigbox\" class=\"metadata plainlinks dmbox dmbox-disambig\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_gray.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"Disambiguation icon\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/40px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/60px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&a